@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2D3748
    ActorBorderColor #2D3748
    LifeLineBorderColor #2D3748
    ParticipantBorderColor #2D3748
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoxBorderColor #A0AEC0
}

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Client Web SPA" as Client
control "STOMP WebSocket Handler" as WSHandler
control "Spring Security WSS" as Security
control "RealtimeNotificationService" as Service
control "SimpMessagingTemplate" as Messaging
collections "Redis Cache" as Redis

note over Client, Redis
  Preconditions: WebSocket connection authenticated via JWT in STOMP CONNECT header;
  TenantContext resolved from connection parameters.
end note

== WebSocket Handshake & Channel Subscription ==

Client -> WSHandler: WSS Connect ws://host/ws/notifications (STOMP CONNECT)
activate WSHandler
WSHandler -> Security: Validate JWT token & Tenant Header
activate Security
Security --> WSHandler: Authenticated User Principal
deactivate Security

WSHandler -> Redis: SET tenant:{tenantId}:ws_session:{userId} = active
activate Redis
Redis --> WSHandler: Session recorded
deactivate Redis

WSHandler --> Client: STOMP CONNECTED
Client -> WSHandler: SUBSCRIBE /topic/tenant.{tenantId}.user.{userId}
WSHandler --> Client: SUBSCRIBE ACK
deactivate WSHandler

== Realtime Push Event Dispatch ==

Service -> Redis: Check online status tenant:{tenantId}:ws_session:{userId}
activate Service
activate Redis
Redis --> Service: Active session found
deactivate Redis

Service -> Messaging: convertAndSendToUser(userId, "/topic/tenant.{tenantId}.user.{userId}", payload)
activate Messaging
Messaging -> WSHandler: Dispatch STOMP frame
activate WSHandler
deactivate Messaging

WSHandler -> Client: Push Realtime STOMP MESSAGE Frame
deactivate WSHandler
Client -> Client: Trigger UI Toast & Audio Alert
deactivate Service

@enduml
